1
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,640
Well, well.

4
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,200
Lord Han was right.

5
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:09,400
- You really have come up in the world.
- You…

6
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,960
When I ran into you on the street,

7
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,160
you looked so grand,

8
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,440
like a goddess descended from Heaven.

9
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,480
I hardly recognized you.

10
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,320
Thanks to Lord Han,

11
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,840
our family is finally reunited,
and we siblings can meet again.

12
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,440
Come to think of it,

13
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,960
you hid yourself awfully well back then.

14
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:45,000
A beauty like you
spent every day hauling filth?

15
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,880
- If I'd known you were this beautiful…
- What?

16
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,240
Would you have sold me
somewhere disreputable

17
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,600
or made me an old man's concubine,

18
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,480
just to get money
for drinking and gambling?

19
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,080
Where are Ma and Hongxian?

20
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,560
They're living in luxury
at the Han Residence.

21
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,160
They've got it good there.

22
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:05,520
Is this real gold thread?

23
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,440
How dare you!

24
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,120
- You…!
- Don't you dare!

25
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,720
Whatever you say.

26
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,960
I won't waste my time
on this clueless maid.

27
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,520
Tell me.

28
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,280
What does Han Liao want me to do?

29
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,880
Lord Han said
he didn't care about your true identity.

30
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,280
He only wants you to do one thing for him.

31
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,120
Once it's done,
he'll give you 10,000 liang of gold.

32
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,880
What is it?

33
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,360
Actually, you don't have to
do anything yourself.

34
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,040
Lord Han has arranged everything.

35
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:40,240
You just need to find a way
to get someone into the ancestral temple,

36
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:42,120
and he'll take care of placing the item.

37
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,000
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

38
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,040
A-Chou said she'd find
a renowned physician for ma,

39
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:52,520
then buy a large residence
and bring us there to live in comfort!

40
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,640
She also said she'd find me a wife

41
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,640
and open
a three-story gambling house for me!

42
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,520
She hates gamblers.

43
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,960
She'd never open one for you.

44
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:04,520
Tell Ma the truth.

45
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,800
What else did she say?

46
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,520
She also said
she was always thinking of you both,

47
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:11,240
and…

48
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,720
Runsheng, take good care of Mother.

49
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,240
And give Hongxian a message for me.

50
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,680
Tell her I've never forgotten her.

51
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,640
Last night,

52
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:23,240
I even dreamed about taking her
to the market when we were little.

53
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:26,000
She saw a blind girl
tapping a cane, singing,

54
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,240
and earning lots of money,

55
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,400
so she wanted to blind herself
and beg for food too.

56
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,560
Luckily, I stopped her.

57
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,240
Silly girl.

58
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,680
<i>A blind girl singing…</i>

59
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:41,200
<i>Could she have been referring</i>
<i>to "The Tale of the Red Pill"?</i>

60
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:43,960
HIGH CANDLES BEAR THE RADIANCE

61
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:52,200
Mother, you can rest easy now.

62
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,640
She said she'd buy us
a big house to settle in.

63
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,760
I only hope she finishes
what she needs to do soon

64
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,160
so we can finally be together again.

65
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,160
At least she knows what's good for her.

66
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,520
If she keeps stalling,

67
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,320
I'll drag them all
to the Duke of Ying's residence

68
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:19,520
and turn the whole place upside down.

69
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:22,000
Sir, that woman
is cunning and unpredictable.

70
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,760
Will she really do your bidding?

71
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:27,240
I've planted more than one mole
in the Lu Residence.

72
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,880
Someone will make sure she does.

73
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:34,840
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

74
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,760
- This table needs a good wipe too.
- Yes.

75
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:37,840
Be thorough.

76
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:40,400
- You too, over there.
- Yes.

77
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,720
Your Ladyship,
please inspect the arrangements.

78
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:50,440
Have all the damaged ritual objects
been remade?

79
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,360
Rest assured.

80
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,520
The new ritual objects
will arrive this afternoon.

81
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,880
I'll inspect every one of them carefully
before putting them out.

82
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:59,280
The larger pieces
will be placed on the steps outside,

83
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,120
and the smaller ones inside the hall.

84
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,120
The ancestral temple is short-handed.

85
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,240
Her Ladyship finds these men diligent.

86
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,600
She wants them to stay and work here.

87
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,120
Yes.

88
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:14,360
Are all the offerings ready?

89
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,560
Everything is prepared.

90
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,560
We've also assigned people to guard them

91
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,920
against dogs, insects, and rats.

92
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:22,880
The food and wine for the rites
must be clean and carefully prepared.

93
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,920
I need to inspect them myself.

94
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,520
- Lead the way.
- Yes.

95
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,720
This way, your Ladyship. Please.

96
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,640
Come on, let's go. Time to eat.

97
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,360
- Come on, let's eat. Come on, time to eat.
- You go ahead. I'll be right there.

98
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,480
Time to eat.

99
00:06:56,640 --> 00:07:01,520
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

100
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:04,200
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

101
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,320
Before I got married,

102
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,240
Grandmother had clothes made for me
for every season.

103
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,880
I won't need anything new for years,

104
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,120
so there's no need for this, Mother.

105
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,360
That won't do.

106
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:21,960
This ancestral rite is one of
the Lu family's grandest occasions.

107
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:25,280
I'm only a woman of the inner chambers.

108
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,360
There isn't much else I can help with,

109
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:29,160
but dressing you up is something
I can certainly do.

110
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,880
I want everyone outside the family to see

111
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:35,040
that my daughter-in-law
is perfect in every way,

112
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,200
a woman rarely seen in this world.

113
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,200
Let's keep looking.

114
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:43,760
This one…

115
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,480
This one's nice.

116
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:59,880
<i>My Lady, I sketched the object</i>
<i>and quietly showed it to a craftsman.</i>

117
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,960
<i>It's a gold ritual vessel</i>
<i>reserved for imperial rites.</i>

118
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,760
Rao, how do you like this?

119
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,760
Rao?

120
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,680
What's wrong?

121
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,200
Nothing. It's lovely.

122
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,920
Let me pick some more.

123
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:25,880
This color would look lovely
for the ceremonial robe.

124
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:29,520
Should the sleeves be wide or narrow?

125
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,120
Wide. It'll look dignified and elegant.

126
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:36,159
As for the colors of the robe
and silk shoes…

127
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:40,200
We'll have to think
that through carefully.

128
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:02,080
Lord Han told me to give you a message.

129
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:04,080
Either the entire Lu family dies,

130
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:06,000
or you end up dead yourself.

131
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,440
A clever person
should know which to choose.

132
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:21,880
Rao, you seem preoccupied.

133
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:22,880
Is something troubling you?

134
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,680
There are too many details to handle.
My head's spinning from it all.

135
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:28,760
It's all right.

136
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:35,320
Look at this one. What do you think?

137
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,840
The pattern is beautiful.
You have excellent taste, Mother.

138
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:47,000
No? Is it a little too gaudy?

139
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,080
Let's choose another.

140
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,240
That one's good.

141
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,320
I'll get it.

142
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:04,840
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

143
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:36,520
Quiet.

144
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,920
She usually turns in
before the second watch.

145
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,280
What's keeping her up tonight?

146
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:50,160
As you instructed,
Xu Heng is overseeing this ancestral rite.

147
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:52,680
He's sharp and capable
and never makes mistakes.

148
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:54,120
He won't give the her Ladyship
any trouble.

149
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:57,440
How about I go find out what's going on?

150
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,160
Don't meddle.

151
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:03,560
Find out what happened
at the ancestral temple today.

152
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:07,920
Perhaps one of my aunts
deliberately gave her a hard time.

153
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,680
My Lady, you should run.

154
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,440
You've worked so hard to get this far,

155
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:26,760
but Han Liao is using hostages
to force your hand.

156
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,560
If you do as he says,

157
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,360
the entire Lu family will be killed.

158
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:34,120
If you refuse, he'll bring Ms Qiao
and her children to our door.

159
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,560
Once your true identity is exposed,

160
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:38,920
you'll be facing certain ruin.

161
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,320
My Lady, let's leave.

162
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,000
Let's get far away from the capital.

163
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,920
With all this gold, silver, and jewelry,
we can live on it for a year or so.

164
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,680
We?

165
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,480
Bitao,

166
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,520
you'd run away with me?

167
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:02,240
You'd live rough and hide
from place to place with me?

168
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:10,920
I'll run away with you, My Lady.

169
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,840
Wherever you go, I'll go.

170
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,840
Get up.

171
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:23,480
We're not running.

172
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,040
Why not?

173
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,880
If I were Han Liao,

174
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:30,320
I'd have someone watching
my pawn's every move

175
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,480
and never let her slip out of my control.

176
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:36,200
Even if we
manage to leave the Lu Residence,

177
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,240
we still won't make it out of the city.

178
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,000
Then are we really going to frame
the Lu family?

179
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:40,920
Bitao,

180
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:44,320
if I disregard Ma and Hongxian's lives

181
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,000
and refused Han Liao, even to die,

182
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:50,560
he'll simply have someone else do it
so he can ruin the Lu family.

183
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:59,160
Han Liao intends to wipe out the Lu clan.

184
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,640
Why would he spare me alone?

185
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:09,080
Whether I do it or not, death awaits.

186
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:12,360
Either way, we die.

187
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,800
What are we supposed to do?

188
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:23,640
I fought so hard to get where I am.

189
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:28,800
If that villain Han Liao takes
even a grain of sand from me,

190
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,480
I'll make him pay with his life.

191
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,560
There has to be a way out.

192
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,640
Let me think.

193
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,280
Just let me think.

194
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,240
It's getting late.

195
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,640
Don't let Lord Lu get suspicious.

196
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:49,560
What did you just say?

197
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:55,480
I mean, we should put out the candles
so Lord Lu won't grow suspicious.

198
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:58,080
No. Let him.

199
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:06,960
Bitao, this time,

200
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,440
I'll have to bet for my life.

201
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,760
My Lord, Guanzhu said

202
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,320
Her Ladyship had been troubled

203
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,680
ever since she returned
from the ancestral temple

204
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:25,160
and didn't even have dinner.

205
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:37,560
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

206
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:51,440
- A centipede!
- What happened?

207
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,200
My Lady, are you all right?

208
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:55,360
Miss Bitao, where is it?

209
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,160
It was right there!

210
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,920
How could there be
a centipede inside the main hall?

211
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,920
Are you sure?

212
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,520
What do you mean?

213
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:04,480
This place is full of bricks and timber.

214
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,760
Centipedes are bad enough,

215
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,400
but blister beetles would be even worse.

216
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,760
I am fine if one bites me today.

217
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,720
But if one bites the Dowager Lady
or Lord Lu tomorrow,

218
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:11,640
you'll be in serious trouble.

219
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:14,800
- Hurry and find them all!
- Yes.

220
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:16,560
Search every crack and corner.

221
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,600
Look carefully.

222
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,440
- You three, over there! Hurry!
- Yes.

223
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:24,080
Keep looking carefully. There must be one.

224
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:25,240
All right.

225
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:30,680
Bitao, we've cleared away every cobweb
and ant nest in the hall.

226
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:32,640
How could there be a centipede?

227
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,600
You must have been mistaken.

228
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,840
Steward Xu,

229
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:41,040
I've finished checking the offerings.

230
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:43,160
You've done a good job, but…

231
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,880
your Ladyship, is something amiss?

232
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,120
Never mind.

233
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,320
You…

234
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:09,640
My Lord.

235
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,760
FIVE JADE TIGERS

236
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:13,400
Are the items marked in red
all damaged ritual objects?

237
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:16,360
My Lord, 18 ritual objects were damaged.

238
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,920
Replacements were made wherever possible.

239
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,320
Where are the damaged ones kept?

240
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:29,320
The ritual vessels and jades
are all accounted for.

241
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,400
None may go missing or be discarded.

242
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,760
By the old rules,
even sentimental things, worn or broken,

243
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:36,280
still have to be carefully stored
in the rear rooms.

244
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:37,880
Good. At least there are rules.

245
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,240
Fetch Zhao Song and Zhao Bai.

246
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:43,160
Have them check every damaged object
against this register.

247
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,240
Yes.

248
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,840
Why did you summon me, My Lord?

249
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,560
Is this what you've been hiding from me?

250
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,320
What do you mean, My Lord?

251
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,320
I don't understand.

252
00:16:58,400 --> 00:16:59,960
You're still covering for them?

253
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:02,080
We've checked all the fragments
in the rear rooms.

254
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:05,800
Six damaged celadon pieces are missing,
and a jade tiger has vanished.

255
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,240
Even a passing goose leaves a trace.

256
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:10,200
There's no way
shattered jade leaves no trace.

257
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:14,040
They marked them as damaged
and thought they could get away with it.

258
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,720
These ritual objects have been passed down
in the Lu family for generations.

259
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:18,720
What a brazen thief!

260
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:23,079
My Lord, I'll catch the thief!

261
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,040
I'm afraid the thief is one of our own!

262
00:17:26,359 --> 00:17:27,760
Please calm down, My Lord.

263
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,440
The ancestral temple
was managed by the second branch.

264
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,800
If you make a scene,

265
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:36,120
Aunt Chengjun may be embarrassed.

266
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:38,200
Investigate! Investigate thoroughly!

267
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,240
My Lord…

268
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,320
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai.

269
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,320
Shut the gates at once.

270
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:54,160
Take men and detain every servant
who regularly enters the temple.

271
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:56,920
Question them thoroughly
and search the entire place.

272
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:00,960
Perhaps the ritual jade
hasn't been smuggled out yet.

273
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:02,600
- Yes.
- Yes.

274
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,920
Wait!

275
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,120
You know
I've only just married into the family

276
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,200
and want to avoid offending my elders.

277
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,320
Why make such a fuss?

278
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:13,560
Your Ladyship, damage is often reported
at the ancestral temple.

279
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:14,960
Of course the masters know about it.

280
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:18,000
They simply turn a blind eye
to avoid unnecessary trouble.

281
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:20,160
But the jade tiger
was bestowed by the Founding Emperor.

282
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,080
If the Duke checks the inventory,
you'll certainly be held responsible.

283
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:24,120
- His Lordship doesn't want you blamed.
- What are you waiting for? Go!

284
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,840
Go!

285
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,960
Oh no! Something's been stolen
from the ancestral hall again.

286
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:37,040
I've heard it's a jade tiger.

287
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,880
Who would dare steal ritual jade?

288
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:41,320
Exactly. Who'd dare steal something
so valuable?

289
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,440
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

290
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:48,360
- What's going on?
- Seize every servant in this courtyard.

291
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,720
Lock them separately in the rear rooms!

292
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:51,960
- Move!
- I'm innocent!

293
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:52,880
- Hurry!
- I'm no thief!

294
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:54,080
I'm innocent! I swear!

295
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,000
- I'm innocent!
- Move!

296
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:56,200
Why are you taking me?

297
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,400
I'm innocent!

298
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,040
I've been wronged!

299
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:01,200
Can Liangcai handle it?

300
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:05,480
His mother begged me again and again
to let her come kowtow to you.

301
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:08,280
Her whole family has been given easy,
respectable posts.

302
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:10,320
If they can't even handle this small task,

303
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:12,160
they'd be too ashamed to face you.

304
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,920
General Qi.

305
00:19:15,760 --> 00:19:17,040
Not here again?

306
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:19,560
Fine. The Lu family's
ancestral temple, right?

307
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,480
I'll go there myself.

308
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,240
General Qi, please wait.

309
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:26,200
I have a message for you.

310
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:28,480
Lady Rao has a question for you.

311
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,520
Does the promise
you made that day still stand?

312
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,760
<i>If anything ever troubles you,</i>

313
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:36,240
just tell me.

314
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:39,280
I'll help without hesitation.

315
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:43,480
Every word I said to her was sincere.

316
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:46,360
Her Ladyship has an urgent favor to ask.

317
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:48,520
She hopes you won't ask questions
and just do as she asks.

318
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:50,880
Her Ladyship will remember this favor.

319
00:19:56,120 --> 00:19:57,440
Miss Bitao!

320
00:19:58,440 --> 00:19:59,760
Miss Bitao.

321
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,440
Miss Bitao, you're finally here!

322
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:02,480
I'm not a thief.

323
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:05,320
Please tell the her Ladyship
to let me out.

324
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,960
What are you shouting for?

325
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,200
You're not the only one locked up.

326
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,160
An important ritual jade
was stolen from the front hall.

327
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,640
Lord Lu is furious.

328
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:15,960
Even Steward Xu has been detained
for negligence.

329
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:17,600
All right, don't look so miserable.

330
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:19,520
You've only been here two days.

331
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:21,160
You clearly had nothing to do
with the theft.

332
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,920
Her Ladyship will speak up for you.

333
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,080
Just wait.

334
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:27,120
Miss Bitao,
please put in another word for me

335
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:29,400
and get me out soon.

336
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:31,680
I still have work to do.

337
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,520
I know. Just wait.

338
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:43,040
CLANSMEN IN ROBES, UNITED IN CEREMONY

339
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:47,480
I found the stolen item.

340
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:53,800
But this isn't the jade tiger.

341
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:55,160
You found it already?

342
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:57,520
This thief is cunning,

343
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:59,080
hiding it right under everyone's noses.

344
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,560
Who would've thought?

345
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:04,040
What is this?

346
00:21:04,120 --> 00:21:06,600
Someone means
to have the Lu family wiped out

347
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:08,040
and planted this to bring us ruin.

348
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,160
If we hadn't searched for the stolen item,

349
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,600
our whole family
would eventually lose our heads.

350
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:16,480
Throw every servant
in the ancestral temple into the dungeon.

351
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:18,680
I'll interrogate them myself!

352
00:21:19,280 --> 00:21:20,080
My Lord,

353
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:23,840
even catching a snake calls for stealth.

354
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:26,440
If you make such
a show of hunting the thief,

355
00:21:26,520 --> 00:21:27,560
easy to spot the insider.

356
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:29,600
What about an enemy from outside?

357
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:30,960
We can't rush this.

358
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,680
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai,

359
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:37,200
release all the servants
held in the rear rooms.

360
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,200
- Release them?
- Yes. All of them,

361
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:42,280
except one.

362
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:50,160
I've been wronged!

363
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,920
Lord Lu!

364
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,080
- I really didn't steal the jade tiger!
- I told you it wasn't me!

365
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,400
So you're the one who stole it!

366
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,880
And you dragged all of us into it!

367
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:57,840
All right, enough.

368
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:58,840
- Lord Lu!
- Break it up.

369
00:21:58,920 --> 00:21:59,920
Back to work!

370
00:22:01,240 --> 00:22:02,520
- Move along!
- Let's go.

371
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:18,320
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

372
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:29,320
So they really
were investigating a theft today.

373
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:32,480
Good thing they didn't discover
what's hidden here.

374
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:07,160
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

375
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:16,200
All right. Lady Lu
finally has time to see you.

376
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:21,640
My sister's come to pick us up?

377
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:22,920
That's right.

378
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:25,120
Hurry up and get ready.

379
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:26,520
Put on something presentable.

380
00:23:27,040 --> 00:23:28,040
Then come with me,

381
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:30,440
and you can finally be reunited.

382
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:48,520
<i>A-Chou wouldn't mention</i>
<i>"The Tale of the Red Pill" for no reason.</i>

383
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,360
<i>She was sending me a message.</i>

384
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:52,400
<i>She wanted me to…</i>

385
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:53,360
Stop the carriage!

386
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:57,200
Qi Zhongkai?

387
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,560
What are you doing?

388
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:04,600
Commandant Liu, my family's
runaway slaves are in that carriage.

389
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,320
Get them!

390
00:24:18,520 --> 00:24:19,400
Mother!

391
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:20,720
- Get down!
- Mother!

392
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:22,600
- Mother!
- Let's go!

393
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,560
Hurry!

394
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:25,360
Move! Hurry!

395
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,120
Get down!

396
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:32,400
Help!

397
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:33,520
- Qi Zhongkai.
- Help!

398
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:36,440
How dare you gallop through the streets
and openly seize people?

399
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:38,360
Open your eyes and look carefully.

400
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:40,560
This mother and her two children
are runaway slaves from my household.

401
00:24:41,320 --> 00:24:42,680
I reported them to the authorities
three days ago.

402
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:44,800
You harbored my family's runaway slaves.

403
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:46,320
I'll settle that score with you later.

404
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:47,840
You've gone too far!

405
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:48,800
Move!

406
00:24:53,800 --> 00:24:55,600
- My Lord!
- Move!

407
00:24:56,120 --> 00:24:57,200
There's still one here!

408
00:25:01,040 --> 00:25:02,040
Good.

409
00:25:02,120 --> 00:25:06,080
As long as we have her,
the plan won't fail.

410
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:13,120
Do exactly as I say,
or I'll skin you alive.

411
00:25:15,600 --> 00:25:17,520
My Lord, it's almost time
for the Lu family's ancestral rite.

412
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,960
No rush.

413
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:22,200
Everything is ready,

414
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:26,400
but I'm still waiting
for an honored guest.

415
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:30,880
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

416
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:37,600
LU FAMILY'S ANCESTRAL TABLETS

417
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:39,480
Welcome the deities!

418
00:25:39,560 --> 00:25:45,320
ILLUSTRIOUS FAMILY LEGACY

419
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,480
Kneel!

420
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:56,440
On the 15th day of the seventh month,
at this auspicious hour,

421
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:59,600
incense rises as the spirits
come from afar.

422
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:02,440
Ancestors, descend
and receive our grain and offerings.

423
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:05,920
With reverence,
we present these worthy sacrifices.

424
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:09,320
Accept these offerings
and witness our sincerity.

425
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:12,520
May our ancestors descend and partake,

426
00:26:12,600 --> 00:26:14,600
and be comforted by our filial devotion!

427
00:26:48,560 --> 00:26:50,400
Prince Rong arrives!

428
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:52,440
This is our ancestral temple.
You may not barge in!

429
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:53,440
Move aside!

430
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:56,080
- What are you doing?
- What's this?

431
00:26:56,600 --> 00:26:57,680
- What are you doing?
- Move!

432
00:26:57,760 --> 00:26:58,880
This is no place for you to cause trouble!

433
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,440
Stop at once!

434
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:08,480
PRINCE RONG, THE EMPEROR'S YOUNGER BROTHER

435
00:27:10,360 --> 00:27:12,880
My Lord, who is he?

436
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:16,200
The Empress Dowager's youngest son
and His Majesty's younger brother,

437
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:19,320
Prince Rong,
who backed Han Liao for military command.

438
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:38,360
Your Highness, forgive me
for not welcoming you sooner.

439
00:27:48,600 --> 00:27:50,880
I ran into a mad dog on the way,

440
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:53,400
and it caused me to fall from my horse.

441
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:55,920
I've defiled
your family's ancestral temple.

442
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:56,840
My apologies.

443
00:27:58,600 --> 00:27:59,840
My apologies.

444
00:28:01,120 --> 00:28:02,200
Bring her in!

445
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:28,520
- Your Highness…
- Please, just be patient for now.

446
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:34,240
I came here today to help your family
catch a thief.

447
00:28:34,320 --> 00:28:35,920
A thief?

448
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:38,560
Your Highness must be joking.

449
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:40,120
This is the Lu family's ancestral temple,

450
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:43,000
where we worship our ancestors.

451
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:44,520
What thief could there be here?

452
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,600
Take a good look.

453
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:52,040
Who is she?

454
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:03,560
During the recent war with the Hutuo,

455
00:29:04,080 --> 00:29:06,000
the Empress Dowager recommended
Your Highness for command twice.

456
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:09,840
But the Lu family
kept obstructing you at every turn,

457
00:29:10,800 --> 00:29:12,320
until His Majesty grew suspicious

458
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:14,440
and refused to entrust you
with military command.

459
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:18,200
Now, removing
this threat is not difficult.

460
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:20,160
Just follow my plan.

461
00:29:20,680 --> 00:29:22,680
First, we'll convict the Lu family
of using an impostor

462
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:24,480
to deceive the sovereign.

463
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:27,000
Then we'll use that
as grounds for a thorough search.

464
00:29:27,080 --> 00:29:31,520
Once we find an imperial ritual vessel
hidden in the Lu ancestral temple…

465
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:33,560
Are you absolutely certain it'll work?

466
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:34,720
Rest assured, Your Highness.

467
00:29:34,800 --> 00:29:38,240
I call this plan "Snaring the Dragon
and Binding the Tiger."

468
00:29:38,320 --> 00:29:42,200
It will leave Lu dead, his clan destroyed,

469
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:44,800
and everything reduced to ashes.

470
00:29:46,600 --> 00:29:48,240
Oh, Lu Zhuo.

471
00:29:48,320 --> 00:29:49,920
For all your famed shrewdness,

472
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:53,280
you've still been blinded by beauty
and fallen for this woman's charms!

473
00:29:54,080 --> 00:29:57,440
Take a good look
at the lovely wife by your side.

474
00:29:57,520 --> 00:29:59,760
Is she truly a noble lady
from the Earl of Cheng'an's household,

475
00:29:59,840 --> 00:30:01,000
or…

476
00:30:02,760 --> 00:30:04,760
Han Liao,
who gave you leave to cause trouble here?

477
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,560
Everyone here can see for themselves!

478
00:30:11,520 --> 00:30:12,840
Take a good look.

479
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:17,440
The wife of the heir to the Duke of Ying
is this girl's elder sister!

480
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:20,680
She's no noble lady
from an earl's household.

481
00:30:21,760 --> 00:30:26,280
She's a criminal from the slums
with blood on her hands!

482
00:30:27,120 --> 00:30:28,320
- What?
- How can it be?

483
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:29,440
That's not possible.

484
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:34,320
How will he know?

485
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:41,240
Miss,

486
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:46,440
this is her Ladyship
of the Duke of Ying's household.

487
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:48,040
Take a good look.

488
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:50,520
Is she really your sister?

489
00:30:56,080 --> 00:30:57,880
Sister, save me!

490
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:59,640
It's me, Hongxian!

491
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:01,880
She can't even recognize her own sister?

492
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:04,960
Lord Han,
what a fine witness you've found.

493
00:31:05,840 --> 00:31:07,120
You've got the wrong person.

494
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:10,000
She's Lord Lu's wife.

495
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:13,600
Your Ladyship, I was wrong!

496
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:15,360
I never meant to frame you!

497
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:18,320
It was him! He forced me to do it!

498
00:31:18,840 --> 00:31:20,960
You wretch!
How dare you give false testimony?

499
00:31:22,840 --> 00:31:24,760
Don't be afraid.

500
00:31:26,920 --> 00:31:28,480
Han Liao must have abducted you

501
00:31:28,560 --> 00:31:30,280
and brought you here for a reason.

502
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:32,920
Take your time.

503
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,880
Tell us everything.

504
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:38,480
The Duke of Ying's household
will see justice done.

505
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:44,040
Your Graces, save me!

506
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:47,160
I came to the capital with my mother
to seek treatment.

507
00:31:47,240 --> 00:31:50,800
Somehow, I was abducted
and taught a whole story to recite.

508
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:52,720
What did he tell you to say?

509
00:31:52,800 --> 00:31:53,720
Nonsense!

510
00:31:54,520 --> 00:31:55,440
Let her speak!

511
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,240
If you keep spouting nonsense,

512
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:03,520
I'll break every bone in your body!

513
00:32:03,600 --> 00:32:04,800
Enough!

514
00:32:04,880 --> 00:32:09,280
How dare you threaten her
right in front of me?

515
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:11,640
Go on. Tell us everything.

516
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:15,160
He told me to call her Ladyship my sister

517
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:17,520
and accuse her of being an impostor,

518
00:32:17,600 --> 00:32:19,440
so he could cause trouble
for the Lu family.

519
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:22,840
I'm just an illiterate country girl.

520
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:25,280
I couldn't even remember
all the lies he made up.

521
00:32:25,360 --> 00:32:28,160
I told him I wouldn't do it,
but he forced me.

522
00:32:28,760 --> 00:32:30,280
He said if I refused to come,

523
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:33,880
he'd kill my mother!

524
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:42,160
Old Madam Wei was at our house
for a banquet not long ago.

525
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:44,680
Neither her own grandmother
nor anyone in the Wei family

526
00:32:44,760 --> 00:32:47,640
found anything wrong.

527
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:50,280
Yet an outsider like you
claims to know better?

528
00:32:50,360 --> 00:32:52,800
How utterly absurd.

529
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:54,680
To fabricate evidence against someone,

530
00:32:54,760 --> 00:32:56,240
you've concocted an outrageous lie.

531
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:57,240
How utterly shameless.

532
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,600
Miss, we're here for you.

533
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:00,560
Don't be afraid.

534
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:02,440
You villain!

535
00:33:02,960 --> 00:33:05,400
How dare you slander Lady Rao? Get out!

536
00:33:05,480 --> 00:33:07,280
- Get out!
- Stop them!

537
00:33:07,360 --> 00:33:08,400
- Get out!
- Go!

538
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:09,320
Stop them!

539
00:33:09,400 --> 00:33:10,320
- Stop!
- Get out!

540
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:11,280
This is outrageous!

541
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:14,120
Han Liao,

542
00:33:15,560 --> 00:33:18,480
show us your conclusive evidence.

543
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:25,080
You think a petty trick like that
can save you?

544
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:26,560
You're dreaming!

545
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:30,400
I was never worried about this wretch
changing her story.

546
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:33,160
It's too late to plug a leak
once the boat is midstream.

547
00:33:33,240 --> 00:33:34,400
Once I produce the hard evidence,

548
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:36,400
let's see how your family
gets out of this!

549
00:33:56,840 --> 00:33:58,320
You brought someone for me to meet.

550
00:33:58,400 --> 00:33:59,480
What a coincidence.

551
00:34:00,320 --> 00:34:03,240
I also have someone I'd like you to meet.

552
00:34:04,560 --> 00:34:05,560
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai,

553
00:34:07,040 --> 00:34:08,239
bring him in!

554
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:15,000
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

555
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:24,080
Lu Zhuo, what exactly is going on?

556
00:34:25,199 --> 00:34:28,679
What was he looking for
in our ancestral temple?

557
00:34:41,080 --> 00:34:42,239
A gold ritual vessel?

558
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:45,239
He planted this man here

559
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:48,320
to hide gold ritual vessel
reserved for the Emperor,

560
00:34:49,040 --> 00:34:51,120
so he could accuse us
of violating ritual codes

561
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,560
and have our entire clan executed.

562
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:57,800
Han Liao stormed our ancestral temple
for one purpose alone.

563
00:34:58,360 --> 00:34:59,520
He is here to find it!

564
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:02,800
How could something so appalling happen?

565
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:06,200
What grudge could be so deep
to wipe out our entire clan?

566
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:07,800
How vicious the Han family is!

567
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:10,000
They're declaring war on the Lu family!

568
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:13,680
You knew all along and set a trap
just for me!

569
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:14,640
This is nothing but slander.

570
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:16,520
Guards!

571
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,560
How could you be so reckless?

572
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:25,000
Are you hurt? Let me see.

573
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:27,160
Han Liao, you shameless villain!

574
00:35:28,160 --> 00:35:30,360
No wonder you hurled false accusations
and tried every way to frame me.

575
00:35:31,040 --> 00:35:34,360
It was all an excuse
to search our ancestral temple.

576
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:37,160
You planted evidence
and framed a loyal family,

577
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:39,160
smashed our altar
and dishonored our ancestors,

578
00:35:39,240 --> 00:35:42,000
and even tried to destroy
the entire Lu clan!

579
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:44,680
One crime after another.

580
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:47,040
You have the heart of a jackal
and the venom of a wasp.

581
00:35:47,120 --> 00:35:49,600
To destroy a house and ruin a clan,
a crime beyond forgiveness.

582
00:35:58,400 --> 00:36:01,160
The forebears of the Lu family
gave their lives for the nation,

583
00:36:01,240 --> 00:36:02,960
shedding their blood on the battlefield.

584
00:36:03,040 --> 00:36:06,960
And even in death,
their spirits are denied peace.

585
00:36:08,600 --> 00:36:10,480
Even if the Lu family
killed you here and now,

586
00:36:10,560 --> 00:36:12,720
you'd only be getting what you deserve!

587
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:18,640
We've been grievously wronged!

588
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:24,840
You despicable lackey!

589
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:26,840
You've gone too far!

590
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:28,400
Do you really think the Lu family
has no men left?

591
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:29,560
You monster!

592
00:36:29,640 --> 00:36:31,040
- Men of the Lu family,
- He's bullying the widows

593
00:36:31,120 --> 00:36:33,000
- can you stand by and watch this?
- and orphans in our family!

594
00:36:33,080 --> 00:36:36,000
This villain wrecked our temple
and dishonored our ancestors.

595
00:36:36,680 --> 00:36:39,160
Anyone with Lu blood in his veins
cannot let him off!

596
00:36:39,240 --> 00:36:40,960
Our ancestors are watching.

597
00:36:41,040 --> 00:36:43,040
We have to destroy this villain!

598
00:36:43,640 --> 00:36:44,960
- Get him!
- Shut the gates!

599
00:36:45,560 --> 00:36:47,480
Don't let a single one escape! Get lost!

600
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,520
Get lost!

601
00:36:55,720 --> 00:36:57,880
- Protect the ladies.
- Yes.

602
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:59,920
- Let's go. What an outrage!
- Go!

603
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:01,160
Zhuo…

604
00:37:11,040 --> 00:37:13,600
What disgraceful behavior! Stop!

605
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,560
Beat them!

606
00:37:17,640 --> 00:37:18,880
Beat every last one of them!

607
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:23,560
The Lu family helped the Founding Emperor
conquer this realm.

608
00:37:23,640 --> 00:37:27,160
For generations, we've given our all
and sworn to serve the nation unto death!

609
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:29,960
So many died on the battlefield.

610
00:37:30,040 --> 00:37:32,280
Three of my sons never came home.

611
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:34,440
You dare smash our ancestral temple,

612
00:37:34,520 --> 00:37:37,120
disturb our honored dead,
and accuse us of treason?

613
00:37:38,040 --> 00:37:39,600
Even before His Majesty,

614
00:37:39,680 --> 00:37:41,440
I'd still have you beaten!

615
00:37:41,520 --> 00:37:43,800
Beat them! Beat every last one of them!

616
00:37:43,880 --> 00:37:47,520
Any man who holds back is unworthy of
being a man of the Lu family!

617
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:50,000
Hit them! Hit them hard!

618
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:52,080
Oh, you! Unbelievable!

619
00:37:59,200 --> 00:38:00,160
I'm His Majesty's brother!

620
00:38:00,240 --> 00:38:01,320
How dare you hit me!

621
00:38:02,440 --> 00:38:03,400
Coward!

622
00:38:05,680 --> 00:38:06,800
Hit him!

623
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:11,640
You hit me!

624
00:38:19,560 --> 00:38:21,320
You set me up.

625
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:24,160
Good thing you were here, My Lord.

626
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:32,880
Get up!

627
00:38:44,640 --> 00:38:47,320
Lu Zhuo, come with me to the palace.

628
00:38:53,600 --> 00:38:55,080
Wait for me.

629
00:39:07,560 --> 00:39:10,680
Oh, Rao, you were far too reckless.

630
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:13,400
Exactly.
What if a punch had scarred your face?

631
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:15,160
What would you do then?

632
00:39:15,240 --> 00:39:17,720
As long as there's one man
left in the Lu family,

633
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:20,560
they'd never let the ladies risk lives.

634
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:22,080
If anything like this happens again,

635
00:39:22,160 --> 00:39:23,320
you mustn't put yourself in danger.

636
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:30,680
Rao, you were fearless in the face
of danger and acted with such courage.

637
00:39:31,480 --> 00:39:35,000
Everyone, look.
Now that's a true lady of the Lu family!

638
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:43,400
Zhuo is truly fortunate.

639
00:39:49,680 --> 00:39:51,240
Mother, stop hitting me! Please, Mother!

640
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:53,240
You helped outsiders
plot against your sister,

641
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:56,560
- you heartless beast!
- Mother, I was wrong!

642
00:39:56,640 --> 00:39:57,480
You deserve it.

643
00:39:58,080 --> 00:39:59,200
<i>The Tale of the Red Pill</i>
is about Ruiniang,

644
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:02,000
who was abducted by villains
and used her wits to escape.

645
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:04,400
I knew at once you were warning me

646
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:06,240
that Han Liao was up to no good.

647
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,040
I was wrong.

648
00:40:09,120 --> 00:40:11,560
Liangcai will arrange for you
to go to Anling.

649
00:40:11,640 --> 00:40:13,800
There's a retired
Imperial Physician Wang there

650
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:15,680
who specializes
in treating wasting illnesses.

651
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:17,960
I've prepared a letter of introduction
and his fee.

652
00:40:18,640 --> 00:40:20,160
Take this box with you.

653
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:24,200
Han Liao and the Wei family
are all trying to harm you.

654
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:26,520
Why not come with us?

655
00:40:29,880 --> 00:40:30,840
My daughter,

656
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:33,960
you should get away while you still can.

657
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:43,360
Once you reach Anling,

658
00:40:44,040 --> 00:40:45,560
as soon as your escorts leave,

659
00:40:45,640 --> 00:40:47,520
head straight to Yong County
to find Imperial Physician Wang.

660
00:40:48,720 --> 00:40:49,600
So he isn't in Anling?

661
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:53,080
Don't worry. I understand.

662
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:55,640
Other than you, I trust no one.

663
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:01,920
My dear brother,

664
00:41:02,000 --> 00:41:03,360
you thought Lord Han was powerful,
didn't you?

665
00:41:06,760 --> 00:41:08,080
But with just a little maneuvering,

666
00:41:08,160 --> 00:41:10,640
I exposed his plot
and had him thrown in prison.

667
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:14,520
Don't ever follow his example. Otherwise…

668
00:41:17,160 --> 00:41:19,040
I dreamed about Pa last night.

669
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:20,960
He said he missed you.

670
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,600
I… I'll

671
00:41:23,680 --> 00:41:25,960
take good care of Mother
and Hongxian from now on.

672
00:41:26,040 --> 00:41:27,840
I'll never defy you again!

673
00:41:27,920 --> 00:41:29,560
If you say east, I dare not go west.

674
00:41:29,640 --> 00:41:31,400
If you say shoo the dog,
I dare not chase the chicken.

675
00:41:31,480 --> 00:41:33,840
Otherwise,
may Heaven strike me with lightning!

676
00:41:41,600 --> 00:41:44,560
CHANGLE PALACE

677
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:50,200
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

678
00:41:50,280 --> 00:41:52,360
The Eldest Princess has gone in
to talk to the Empress Dowager.

679
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:54,200
She'll surely calm her down.

680
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:08,800
Your Majesty,

681
00:42:09,680 --> 00:42:11,360
Xiao is your own brother.

682
00:42:11,440 --> 00:42:13,280
He's always been rash by nature.

683
00:42:13,360 --> 00:42:16,080
Outsiders have simply led him astray.

684
00:42:16,800 --> 00:42:19,600
Why not forgive him this once,

685
00:42:19,680 --> 00:42:21,320
so Mother won't worry herself sick?

686
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:23,080
She still refuses to eat.

687
00:42:23,160 --> 00:42:26,000
As her children,
how can we bear to see that?

688
00:42:26,080 --> 00:42:28,480
This isn't the first time
he's acted so recklessly.

689
00:42:29,440 --> 00:42:31,880
Everyone knows
Mother dotes on her youngest son.

690
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:34,800
Their bond is the envy of all.

691
00:42:34,880 --> 00:42:36,200
But in this world,

692
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:38,880
Prince Rong isn't the only one
with a mother!

693
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:40,920
Wasn't everyone else
born and raised by parents too?

694
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:43,640
Don't they revere their ancestors
and honor their parents?

695
00:42:44,720 --> 00:42:45,560
And what did he do?

696
00:42:45,640 --> 00:42:47,840
He stormed the Lu family's
ancestral temple

697
00:42:47,920 --> 00:42:50,520
and desecrated the spirits of loyal men
without cause,

698
00:42:50,600 --> 00:42:51,680
causing an uproar throughout the capital.

699
00:42:52,280 --> 00:42:53,960
Sister, go outside and see for yourself.

700
00:42:54,040 --> 00:42:55,920
Right now, the censors are
blocking the palace gates.

701
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:58,920
asking me to severely punish Prince Rong
and the Hans for their crimes.

702
00:42:59,520 --> 00:43:01,840
Tell me, as Emperor,
what am I supposed to do?

703
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:04,120
- I…
- He may as well kill his own brother

704
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:06,880
and never come see me again!

705
00:43:08,320 --> 00:43:10,320
Your Majesty, you…

706
00:43:10,400 --> 00:43:14,600
CHANGLE PALACE

707
00:43:15,200 --> 00:43:17,000
Has she forgotten that

708
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:20,160
this man she's threatening
with a hunger strike

709
00:43:21,640 --> 00:43:23,520
is also her own son?

710
00:43:26,080 --> 00:43:28,080
Your Majesty!

711
00:43:35,920 --> 00:43:39,400
ZHOU FU, LADY LI OF HANDSOME FAIRNESS

712
00:44:32,680 --> 00:44:33,680
Who told you to come?

713
00:44:33,760 --> 00:44:36,760
I was taking a nap
in my chambers this afternoon

714
00:44:36,840 --> 00:44:39,400
when I dreamed of a tiny man

715
00:44:39,480 --> 00:44:41,040
crawling out from my pillow.

716
00:44:41,120 --> 00:44:44,000
He gave me a hard shove and shouted,

717
00:44:44,080 --> 00:44:48,720
"Wake up! Someone has wronged His Majesty!

718
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:52,000
Hurry and go check on him!"

719
00:44:53,880 --> 00:44:55,000
You're always talking nonsense.

720
00:45:00,320 --> 00:45:01,960
Who's wronged Your Majesty?

721
00:45:02,040 --> 00:45:03,080
Tell me.

722
00:45:03,160 --> 00:45:04,480
I'll go teach them a lesson.

723
00:45:04,560 --> 00:45:06,480
A tiny man came to you in a dream?

724
00:45:07,560 --> 00:45:09,880
Everyone knows my sister
is the one who keeps you informed.

725
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:15,040
Don't you know exactly what's on my mind?

726
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:22,480
Your Majesty,

727
00:45:22,560 --> 00:45:24,920
the Empress Dowager
has always doted on Prince Rong.

728
00:45:25,000 --> 00:45:27,160
She couldn't bear
to send him back to his fief,

729
00:45:27,240 --> 00:45:29,680
so she kept him in the capital
for two whole years.

730
00:45:30,320 --> 00:45:32,760
She built him a grand residence

731
00:45:32,840 --> 00:45:35,480
and showered him
with jewels and treasures.

732
00:45:36,000 --> 00:45:37,480
In her eyes,

733
00:45:37,560 --> 00:45:40,040
Prince Rong has only
made a few minor mistakes.

734
00:45:40,120 --> 00:45:44,160
As his brother, can't Your Majesty
show him some leniency?

735
00:45:46,840 --> 00:45:49,920
I've turned a blind eye
to all his past misconduct

736
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:51,840
solely out of respect for Mother.

737
00:45:51,920 --> 00:45:56,240
But now, he nearly
had the entire Lu family executed,

738
00:45:57,120 --> 00:45:59,720
shook the foundations of the state,
and provoked public outrage.

739
00:45:59,800 --> 00:46:01,840
Yet Mother still wants me to spare him.

740
00:46:01,920 --> 00:46:05,640
I might as well give up the throne
and hand everything over to him.

741
00:46:06,160 --> 00:46:08,880
Perhaps then Mother
will finally be satisfied!

742
00:46:10,480 --> 00:46:12,040
Then why not execute Prince Rong?

743
00:46:17,560 --> 00:46:19,520
He's the apple of
the Empress Dowager's eye.

744
00:46:20,240 --> 00:46:21,920
You simply cannot kill him.

745
00:46:22,000 --> 00:46:26,200
If you can't kill him,
why not let him off?

746
00:46:26,280 --> 00:46:27,800
Let him off?

747
00:46:29,520 --> 00:46:31,720
Then how should I face the Lu family?

748
00:46:31,800 --> 00:46:34,960
And how am I to govern my officials
or calm the public outrage?

749
00:46:38,840 --> 00:46:41,440
If I give Your Majesty a solution,

750
00:46:41,520 --> 00:46:43,440
how will you reward me?

751
00:46:45,200 --> 00:46:46,200
Let's hear it.

752
00:46:47,680 --> 00:46:49,480
If Prince Rong committed no grave offense,

753
00:46:49,560 --> 00:46:51,280
then the fault must lie with someone else.

754
00:46:53,240 --> 00:46:55,640
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

755
00:47:00,320 --> 00:47:03,440
Where on earth did you run off to?

756
00:47:03,520 --> 00:47:05,480
Mother has been waiting for ages.

757
00:47:06,720 --> 00:47:07,560
Greetings, Grandmother.

758
00:47:08,720 --> 00:47:10,840
If you need anything, just send for me.

759
00:47:11,440 --> 00:47:13,040
How could I keep you waiting?

760
00:47:13,640 --> 00:47:16,160
Rao, an oral decree
has come from the palace.

761
00:47:16,240 --> 00:47:18,920
His Majesty wants to see you and Zhuo.

762
00:47:21,720 --> 00:47:23,040
His Majesty's summons

763
00:47:23,760 --> 00:47:25,240
must be about the case of
Prince Rong and Han Liao.

764
00:47:26,400 --> 00:47:27,800
If His Majesty wants answers,

765
00:47:27,880 --> 00:47:29,680
he can question you or your grandfather.

766
00:47:29,760 --> 00:47:33,760
At worst, he could summon every man
in our household.

767
00:47:34,280 --> 00:47:37,200
Why would he summon Rao for no reason?

768
00:47:40,680 --> 00:47:44,040
Perhaps someone in the palace

769
00:47:44,120 --> 00:47:46,120
wants a chance to meet
the Lu family's new bride.

770
00:47:49,040 --> 00:47:50,920
<i>Could it be Lady Li in the palace,</i>

771
00:47:51,600 --> 00:47:53,600
<i>Lady Wei Rao's birth mother,</i>
<i>who wants to see me?</i>

772
00:47:56,200 --> 00:47:58,160
Mother and Fourth Aunt
will help you prepare.

773
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:02,600
In an hour, we'll set out to the palace
and meet His Majesty.

774
00:48:04,520 --> 00:48:05,560
Yes.

